      "body_normalized": "I can confirm the refection roughness issue.\n\nSInce it's a regression from Blender 5.1 to 5.2, I will mark this report as high severity and look into bisecting.\n\n---\n\nThe dark spot issue has been in Blender for many versions. So it's a different issue. I will ignore it for this report and would encourage you to make a separate bug report for it.",
